# Normalize text files across platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Common ROM/media/build artifacts should stay binary if they ever appear
# locally; the release guards still forbid committing them.
*.z64 binary
*.n64 binary
*.v64 binary
*.rom binary
*.bin binary
*.bmp binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.raw binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.flac binary
*.dmg binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.tar binary
*.tgz binary
*.gz binary

# Keep GitHub language statistics focused on mdkr64-owned code. These are the
# build-time vendored dependencies documented in NOTICE.md (retained for build
# compatibility, each under its own upstream license). MGB64's equivalent list
# (tools/armips.cpp, tools/asm-processor/**, tools/extractor/*, tools/gzipsrc/**,
# tools/smaa/*, tools/ido5.3_recomp/**, tools/mktex/**) has no counterpart here —
# mdkr64 vendors only these two.
lib/glad/** linguist-vendored
lib/sdl_gamecontrollerdb/** linguist-vendored

# The repository is public and keeps normal history. `export-ignore` is not a
# privacy mechanism; private working material belongs outside tracked paths and
# is rejected by tools/check_public_surface.py before commit, push, and in CI.
